  "description": "Victoria Borisova-Ollas is a major Swedish composer, recipient of prestigious international prizes and awards. She works in a wide variety of musical genres which include chamber, choral, instrumental, orchestral, string orchestral, music for stage and theatre, opera, and ballet. Her critically acclaimed music is popular with audiences and is widely commissioned and performed by major orchestras worldwide.",
